&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;Bugs Fixed&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fixed an issue with Copy transfers where if the source file/directory name contained certain special characters, the destination file name would incorrectly contain the encoded version of these characters.&lt;/li&gt;
